{
  "name": "API Documentation Generator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "generate-api-docs",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e7f8a9b0-1234-56ab-cdef-890abcdef012",
      "name": "Webhook - API Endpoints",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "api-docs-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:11434/generate",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "model",
              "value": "codellama"
            },
            {
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "=Genera documentación completa de API en formato OpenAPI 3.0 para el siguiente endpoint:\n\nMétodo: {{ $json.method }}\nRuta: {{ $json.path }}\nDescripción: {{ $json.description }}\n\nCódigo del controller:\n```\n{{ $json.code }}\n```\n\nGenera:\n1. Especificación OpenAPI 3.0 completa\n2. Descripción detallada del endpoint\n3. Parámetros de entrada (query, path, body)\n4. Respuestas posibles (200, 400, 404, 500)\n5. Ejemplos de request/response\n6. Esquemas de datos\n7. Autenticación requerida\n8. Rate limiting\n9. Deprecated warnings si aplica"
            },
            {
              "name": "stream",
              "value": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f8a9b0c1-2345-67ab-cdef-90abcdef0123",
      "name": "Generate OpenAPI Spec",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "ollama-api",
          "name": "Ollama API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const spec = $input.item.json.response;\nconst endpoint = $('Webhook - API Endpoints').item.json;\n\n// Intentar parsear como YAML/JSON\nlet parsedSpec = {};\ntry {\n  // Extraer el bloque YAML/JSON del response\n  const match = spec.match(/```(?:yaml|json)?\\n([\\s\\S]+?)\\n```/);\n  if (match) {\n    const specText = match[1];\n    parsedSpec = JSON.parse(specText);\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  // Si falla el parsing, usar el texto completo\n  parsedSpec = { raw: spec };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    method: endpoint.method,\n    path: endpoint.path,\n    documentation: spec,\n    openApiSpec: parsedSpec,\n    version: '3.0.0',\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "a9b0c1d2-3456-78ab-cdef-1234567890ab",
      "name": "Parse OpenAPI Spec",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "schema": "public",
        "table": "api_documentation",
        "columns": "method, path, documentation, openapi_spec, version, created_at",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "b0c1d2e3-4567-89ab-cdef-234567890abc",
      "name": "Save Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [850, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "postgres-main",
          "name": "PostgreSQL Main"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-5678-90ab-cdef-34567890abcd",
      "name": "Return Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1050, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - API Endpoints": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate OpenAPI Spec",
